UPDATE companies SET description='Cascade Solar is a locally owned solar installation company based in Portland, Oregon. Founded by Tom Crowe and David Nicholls out of a personal commitment to solar energy, the business began after Crowe managed over 500 residential installations at a large regional solar firm and Nicholls brought more than a decade of experience as an electrician in the solar industry. The pair started the company together with the intention of staying small and growing at a sustainable pace.

The company provides custom solar system design, permitting, installation, activation, and ongoing maintenance for homes and businesses. Services include battery backup installation using equipment from FranklinWH, Tesla Powerwall, Enphase, and Sol-Ark, as well as real-time monitoring with production alerts and fault detection. Routine maintenance covers physical inspections, hardware checks, wiring, and performance reviews, all supported by a 10-year workmanship warranty.

Cascade Solar serves residential homeowners, commercial property owners, and multi-unit residential communities, including affordable housing projects. Notable projects include a 30 kW solar-plus-battery system for a complex Portland roof and a green apartment community installation. The company also offers financing guidance, incentive consultation, and personalized system sizing.

The founders emphasize honest pricing, quality craftsmanship, and a neighborly approach, encouraging customers to compare quotes. Their differentiation rests on a 10-year workmanship warranty, a commitment to never sacrifice core values for growth, and a focus on transparent, stress-free service from consultation through activation.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar system design", "Permitting", "Solar panel installation", "Battery backup installation", "System activation", "Routine maintenance", "Physical inspections", "Performance monitoring", "Real-time monitoring", "Production alerts", "Fault detection", "Monthly performance reviews", "Mobile app assistance", "Surge protection installation", "Critter guard installation", "Warranty support", "Financing guidance", "Incentive consultation", "System sizing", "Roof assessment", "Project planning"], "industries": ["Residential solar", "Commercial solar", "Multi-family residential", "Affordable housing"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["FranklinWH Battery Backup", "Tesla Powerwall", "Enphase Batteries", "Sol-Ark Backup"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["10-year workmanship warranty on all installations", "Locally owned small business with neighbor-focused service", "Custom solar and battery system design tailored to each property", "Real-time monitoring with production alerts and fault detection", "Flexible financing options with upfront incentive guidance"], "facts_used": ["Founded by Tom Crowe and David Nicholls -> /about", "Locally owned small business in Portland, Oregon -> /about, /", "Provides custom solar system design, permitting, installation, activation, maintenance -> /", "Installs battery backup equipment from FranklinWH, Tesla Powerwall, Enphase, Sol-Ark -> /", "Offers real-time monitoring with production alerts and fault detection -> /", "Provides 10-year workmanship warranty -> /about, /", "Aims to stay small and grow sustainably -> /about", "Serves residential, commercial, and multi-unit residential customers including affordable housing -> /", "Completed 30 kW solar-plus-battery system for complex Portland roof -> /", "Offers financing guidance, incentive consultation, personalized system sizing -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We provide expert installation, custom system design, and trusted support for homes and businesses.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Small business"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='cascade-solar' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Casco Food Equipment Services Inc is headquartered in Manchester, New Hampshire. The company, led by CEO Sam Moy, has provided commercial food equipment repairs and parts across New Hampshire and beyond for years, establishing itself as the state''s provider for the foodservice industry.

The firm operates as an authorized parts and service distributor for more than 50 manufacturers, maintaining a parts inventory valued at over $1.6 million. Its factory-authorized, CFESA-certified technicians provide 24/7 emergency repairs, preventative maintenance programs, warranty administration, and equipment installation for a wide range of cooking and refrigeration equipment including convection ovens, griddles, charbroilers, combi ovens, steamers, kettles, tilt skillets, fryers, pizza ovens, dishwashers, and toasters.

Casco serves the foodservice and restaurant industries, supporting commercial kitchens throughout New England with same-day repair capability and ongoing maintenance contracts.

