UPDATE companies SET description='Century Sheet Metal operates from Warwick, Rhode Island, where it has served Southern New England for nearly five decades. The company was founded by Charles Patterson Jr. on a mission to deliver quality work and honest service, and it remains a family-owned business now in its third generation under the leadership of President Chaz Patterson and Vice President Chelsea Kwolek.

