UPDATE companies SET description='Charter Wire was founded in 1936 in Milwaukee, Wisconsin. The company operates as a member of the privately held Charter Manufacturing family of companies, which provides vertical integration across steel production, casting, and recycling through sister operations Charter Steel, Charter Casting, and Niles Iron and Metal Company.

