nership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='choice-electronics' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Chris Haynes Electric Supply Inc. operates from Jackson, Mississippi, where it was founded in 1963 by Chris P. Haynes Sr. Haynes Jr. serving as president for the past three decades.

The company maintains a 28,500-square-foot warehouse on South West Street, which it describes as the largest single-location stock of electrical supplies in Mississippi. From this facility, the firm stocks and distributes a broad range of electrical products. Its fleet of trucks delivers materials throughout most of the state, and the company also ships orders nationwide.

The company emphasizes its experienced staff and their product knowledge as key to helping customers identify and obtain the correct parts quickly.

