UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Annapolis, Maryland, Circa Energy is a family-owned solar installation company led by owner Chip and chief operating officer Elena. The firm has been serving the region since at least 2019, focusing on residential photovoltaic projects and offering a turnkey experience that covers every regulatory step.

