UPDATE companies SET description='City Living Design Ltd operates from Chicago, Illinois, where it has supplied custom furniture for over two decades. The company traces its roots to serving restaurants and nightclubs in the Chicago area before expanding to clients across the United States. While the exact founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed, the business emphasizes its long-standing presence in the contract furniture market.

The firm manufactures a range of upholstered and case goods including booths, banquettes, chairs, barstools, tables, lounge seating, and outdoor furniture. Production centers on custom fabrication: booth frames are built from kiln-dried hardwood with sinuous coil springs, webbing, and high-density foam; tabletops are offered in solid wood, butcher block, laminate, granite, glass, and stainless steel with various edge profiles. An in-house design team works with clients from concept through fabrication, and the company ships finished pieces nationwide from its Chicago workroom.

Customers span hospitality, retail, education, and corporate sectors. The company lists major department stores, national restaurant chains, upscale independent restaurants, coffee shops, diners, college campuses, and corporate employee cafes among its commercial accounts. A residential division extends the same commercial-grade construction to home kitchens, dining nooks, and living spaces, serving individual homeowners as well as interior designers and architects.

City Living Design highlights its construction methods as a differentiator—kiln-dried hardwood frames, sinuous coil springs, and high-density foam are cited for durability and ergonomic support. The firm also notes its Allied ASID membership, in-house design assistance, and the ability to deliver commercial-grade furniture for residential applications. Nationwide shipping and a collaborative quote process round out the service model.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture fabrication", "Upholstery", "Woodworking", "Table top fabrication", "Design services", "Banquette fabrication", "Booth construction", "Privacy booth fabrication", "Privacy divider fabrication", "Outdoor furniture fabrication"], "industries": ["Hospitality", "Retail", "Education", "Corporate", "Residential"], "materials": ["Kiln-dried hardwood", "High-density foam", "Sinuous coil springs", "Webbing", "Solid wood", "Butcher block", "Laminate", "Granite", "Glass", "Stainless steel", "Stone laminate", "Color laminate", "Border laminate", "Rustic plank", "Metal aluminum edge", "Self edge", "Vinyl edge"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house design assistance", "Nationwide shipping", "Commercial-grade construction for residential use", "Kiln-dried hardwood frame construction", "Allied ASID member"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Chicago, Illinois -> db", "Over 20 years providing furniture for restaurants and nightclubs -> /about-us", "30 years working with designers, architects and consumers -> /", "Custom fabrication of booths, banquettes, chairs, barstools, tables, lounge, outdoor -> /, /about-us", "Booth construction: kiln-dried hardwood frames, sinuous coil springs, webbing, high-density foam -> /about-us", "Tabletop materials: wood, laminate, granite, glass, stainless steel, solid plank, rustic plank, butcher block, various edges -> /about-us, /", "In-house designers assist with designs -> /about-us", "Residential division offers commercial-grade furniture for homes -> /about-us", "Served major department stores, national chain eateries, upscale restaurants, coffee shops, diners, college campuses, corporate cafes -> /about-us", "Allied ASID member -> /about-us", "Nationwide shipping -> /", "Customer testimonials mention custom banquette fabrication -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Booths are constructed from kiln dried hardwood frames, sinuous coil springs and webbing for resilience and durability, and high-density foam for comfort and support.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='city-living-design-ltd' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='City Mill operates from Honolulu, Hawaii, where it was founded in 1899 by Chung Kun Ai. The business remains family-owned, now led by Chairman Steven C. Ai and his sister Carol Ai May, with President Shari Komo-Matsueda overseeing daily operations.

The company functions as a full-line hardware retailer, stocking lumber, building materials, paint, tools, plumbing, electrical, garden supplies, furniture, and housewares. In addition to retail sales, City Mill offers assembly on select items, online ordering with free in-store pickup, and local delivery from its stores. The eight locations serve the entire island of Oahu.

Its product assortment spans automotive and garage supplies, paint, power tools, garden and outdoor living, and native plants, reflecting the needs of the local community.

