UPDATE companies SET description='Clothing Head 2 Toe operates from Scottsdale, Arizona, where it has served the community for over 25 years as a locally owned apparel decoration shop. The business is led by President and Sales Director Vicki Canen, who brings more than 25 years of industry experience, alongside Vice President of Operations Rudy Jaramillo, embroidery department head Juan A. Cavazos, and assistant Lucy.

The shop provides screen printing, embroidery, sublimation, direct-to-film heat transfer, and tackle twill services, producing custom decorated apparel such as safety garments, jackets, duffle bags, and backpacks. It also offers graphic design support and promotional product sourcing, handling projects from concept through production with customer approval at each stage.

