UPDATE companies SET description='Coastal Automotive, headquartered in Holland, Michigan, was founded in 2007 as a manufacturer of passive energy management solutions for the mobility sector. The company operates additional manufacturing facilities in Rochester Hills, Michigan, and maintains sales and engineering offices in Seoul and Tokyo.

The company produces energy-absorbing components using proprietary foam materials—IMPAXX™ and TereSorb™—through processes that include die cutting, vacuum and cold forming, compression molding, CNC wire cutting, and 3D printing for customized parts. It offers CAE services, product development, and assembly, with a stated capability to move from prototype to high-volume production without traditional tooling.

Coastal Automotive serves automotive OEMs, motorsports (including NASCAR, for which it is the energy management provider), heavy-truck, marine, and aftermarket customers. Its Michigan headquarters sits near the North American operations of a dozen OEMs, and its global offices support customers across time zones.

The company emphasizes sustainability, recycling 100 percent of unused foam scrap into polystyrene-based products and crafting TereSorb from 100 percent recycled bottles. It operates under Six Sigma and Lean disciplines, holds ISO 9001 and IATF 16949 certifications, and has earned multiple GM Supplier of the Year awards.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','IATF 16949','TISAX Assessment Level 2']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Die cutting", "Vacuum forming", "Cold forming", "Compression molding", "CNC wire cutting", "CAE (Computer-Aided Engineering) services", "Product development", "3D printing for customized parts", "Assembly (multiple methods)", "Rapid prototyping (zero tooling)", "Foam recycling"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Motorsports", "Heavy truck", "Marine", "Aftermarket"], "materials": ["IMPAXX\u2122 foam", "TereSorb\u2122 foam", "Polystyrene", "Recycled PET (bottles)"], "equipment": ["CNC wire cutting machines"], "volume": "Prototype to high-volume production", "lead_time": "Concept to production in days", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Zero production tooling: concept to production in days", "CNC wire cutting for tight tolerances", "100% recycling of manufacturing foam scrap", "TereSorb material made from 100% recycled bottles", "IATF 16949 and ISO 9001 certified facilities"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Holland, Michigan -> db", "Founded in 2007 -> /about", "Manufacturer of passive energy management solutions -> /about", "Uses IMPAXX\u2122 and TereSorb\u2122 foams -> homepage, /about", "Processes: die cutting, vacuum forming, cold forming, compression molding -> capabilities list, homepage", "CNC wire cutting -> capabilities, products", "CAE services -> capabilities", "Product development -> capabilities", "3D technology for large volumes -> products", "Zero production tooling -> products", "Multiple assembly methods -> products", "Recycling 100% of unused foam -> homepage, products", "TereSorb made from 100% recycled bottles -> homepage", "