UPDATE companies SET description='Common Species operates from Longmont, Colorado, as a furniture design and production studio owned and operated by Sergei Parfenov. Parfenov brings a professional design background to the studio, which focuses on hand-building each piece with meticulous attention to detail.

The studio produces custom furniture for residential and commercial clients, including seating, tables, coffee and accent tables, storage, kitchen pieces, and built-ins. Every item is handmade using locally sourced materials and responsible practices, with hardware such as brass locking mechanisms, brass accents, and German-made extension hardware integrated into the designs.

