UPDATE companies SET description='Commonwealth Food Service Equipment operates from Lexington, Kentucky. The company was founded by Stacey Landfield, who moved to Lexington in 1990 and later relaunched the business after the sale of her previous employer. A founding year is not publicly disclosed.

