UPDATE companies SET description='The couple, who also serve as youth pastors in Corpus Christi, Texas, started the company out of a shared passion for clothing as a means of building community. While the exact founding year is not publicly disclosed, the brand emphasizes its Midwestern roots and a mission to gather people through custom apparel.

