UPDATE companies SET description='Consolidated Electronic Wire & Cable, known online as Conwire, operates from Franklin Park, Illinois, where it manufactures standard and custom electronic wire and cable products. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed in available sources.

