UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Lindon, Utah, Copack Utah operates as a contract blending and packaging service for dry food products. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure.

Its core offering is custom dry blending, where each formula receives a tailored procedure that determines the number of blending stages, ingredient sequencing, and the choice between high-shear or gentle tumble action. Packaging capabilities cover automated pouch and bag lines (including stand-up, flat, custom-shaped, and side-gusset formats), canning lines for 603 x 701 (#10) cans, and bulk options such as tote bags, lined boxes, and pails.

The service targets food manufacturers that need outsourced blending and packaging, though the company does not name specific industries or customers. Quality assurance rests on a HACCP-based food safety plan supplemented by independent laboratory testing for microbiological, allergen, water activity, and atmospheric parameters.

