UPDATE companies SET description='Cornerstone Woodworking Co. operates from Neenah, Wisconsin, where owners Troy and Stacy Weyenberg lead a custom cabinetry and woodworking business. Troy Weyenberg, a master craftsman with nearly 30 years in home building and remodeling, oversees production, finishing, and installation. Stacy Weyenberg, a kitchen and bath designer with an interior design background, guides clients through space planning, cabinetry layouts, and finish selection.

The company produces custom cabinetry for residential and commercial projects, including kitchens, bathrooms, pantries, laundry rooms, mudrooms, entertainment centers, and home offices. Its in-house process covers design, production, finishing, and installation, with an emphasis on high-quality materials and craftsmanship. The shop also handles furniture making and millwork for a range of built-in and freestanding pieces.

Cornerstone serves homeowners, builders, interior designers, and general contractors across residential and commercial sectors. The team coordinates directly with other trades on job sites, ensuring that cabinetry integrates smoothly with plumbing, electrical, and structural work. Past projects span single-family remodels, new construction, and commercial fit-outs.

The Weyenbergs emphasize a collaborative, owner-managed approach: Troy supervises each project from the shop floor to final installation, while Stacy works closely with clients to translate functional needs into personalized designs. The company states that its differentiation lies in coordinating every stage—design, production, finishing, and installation—under one roof, maintaining direct communication with clients and trade partners throughout.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinetry", "Kitchen and bath design", "Furniture making", "Millwork", "Cabinet finishing", "Installation", "Design consultation", "Project coordination"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Kitchen and bath remodeling", "Interior design", "Cabinetry"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Owner-managed project oversight from production through installation", "Collaborative approach with clients, contractors, and trade partners", "Full-service process: design, production, finishing, and installation", "High-quality materials and craftsmanship at every stage"], "facts_used": ["Location: Neenah, Wisconsin -> db", "Owners: Troy Weyenberg and Stacy Weyenberg -> /about-us", "Troy Weyenberg: nearly 30 years experience, master craftsman -> /about-us", "Stacy Weyenberg: interior design background, kitchen & bath designer -> /about-us", "Services: custom cabinetry, kitchen & bath design, furniture, millwork -> /services", "Process: design, production, finishing, installation -> /services", "Customer types: homeowners, builders, designers, general contractors -> /services", "Project types: residential, commercial, kitchens, baths, etc. -> /services and /", "Collaborative approach, owner-managed oversight -> /about-us and /services"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "At Cornerstone Woodworking Co., we create custom cabinetry desig