UPDATE companies SET description='Corvia Medical is based in Tewksbury, Massachusetts. The company has been led since 2010 by President and CEO George Fazio, a veteran of the medical device industry with prior leadership roles at St. Jude Medical. The leadership team includes Chief Medical Officer Jan Komtebedde, Vice President of R&D and Operations Ed McNamara, and Vice President of Quality Assurance and Regulatory Affairs Kate Stohlman.

The company is focused on developing an investigational medical device aimed at transforming the standard of care for heart failure treatment. The device is currently limited to investigational use under United States law. Corvia Medical’s operations span research and development, clinical strategy, regulatory affairs, and quality assurance, with a team experienced in cardiovascular device development from prototype through commercialization.

Corvia Medical operates in the cardiovascular medical device sector, targeting heart failure treatment.

The company was built on the collective experience of its leadership team, which brings decades of expertise in structural heart and interventional cardiology devices from companies such as St. Jude Medical, Abbott Vascular, and Medtronic. This background informs Corvia’s approach to developing novel therapies for heart failure.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Prototype development", "Clinical strategy", "Regulatory approvals", "Patent portfolio development", "Quality assurance", "Regulatory affairs"], "industries": ["Medical devices", "Cardiovascular", "Interventional cardiology", "Heart failure treatment"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Leadership team with extensive medical device experience and track record of success", "Commitment to transforming the standard of care for heart failure treatment", "Investigational device under clinical evaluation"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Tewksbury, Massachusetts -> db", "George Fazio CEO since 2010 -> /about-us", "Jan Komtebedde CMO -> /about-us", "Ed McNamara VP R&D and Operations -> /about-us", "Kate Stohlman VP QA/RA -> /about-us", "Investigational device for heart failure -> /about-us", "Leadership experience at St. Jude Medical, Abbott Vascular -> /about-us", "Board of Directors, Investors, Patents -> /about-us", "Company focuses on transforming heart failure treatment -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Corvia Medical\u2019s leadership team is comprised of professionals who share a passion and commitment to transform the standard of care for heart failure treatment.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='corvia-medical' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
